padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">You and your travellers can earn&nbsp;<strong>up to 3,000 bonus Qantas Points</strong>&nbsp;on every eligible Qantas flight* taken by 31 December 2021. With no limit to the number of eligible flights you can book, plus the added flexibility of&nbsp;<b>unlimited fee-free date changes~</b>, it's a great way to grow your business and boost your Qantas Points balance at the same time.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h3" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Three easy steps to bonus points</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px;">1.</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; padding-left: 2px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Simply&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/exclusive-offers/QBRS008.html" target="_blank" title="Register here" style="color: rgb(228, 0, 0);">register</a>&nbsp;your business by 11.59pm AEST 3 June 2021.</font></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px;">2.</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; padding-left: 2px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Book any eligible Qantas flights between&nbsp;<b>25 May and 3 June 2021</b>, for travel by&nbsp;<b>31&nbsp;December 2021</b>.</font></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 